an\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAs it settles, the scent becomes more defined. Jasmine and violet bring a powdery elegance, while a smooth fruity touch adds just enough warmth to keep it balanced without losing its composure. \u003cspan class=\"Apple-converted-space\"\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIn the dry down, musk and sandalwood take over quietly, giving the fragrance structure and presence. It stays controlled, polished, and slightly distant… never trying too hard, yet impossible to ignore. \u003cspan class=\"Apple-converted-space\"\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNotes\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTop Notes: Orange blossom, neroli, almond\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHeart Notes: Jasmine, violet, apricot\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBase Notes: Musk, sandalwood\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBest For \u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpring and summer\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDaytime elegance \u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eConfident, dressed-up moments\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-04-24T02:19:32+03:00","created_at":"2026-04-24T02:11:23+03:00","updated_at":"2026-08-16T18:04:12+03:00","vendor":"Siwa original creation","product_type":"","tags":[],"variants":[{"id":42973010526256,"title":"30 ml","option1":"30 ml","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":true,"taxable":false,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"450.00","grams":0,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":7954863554608,"created_at":"2026-04-24T02:11:23+03:00","updated_at":"2026-08-16T18:04:12+03:00"},{"id":42973010559024,"titl